# Instructions for updating .env.local
# =====================================

You need to replace the placeholder API key with your real Vercel AI Gateway key.

## Current Issue:
Your .env.local file has:
  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="your-anthropic-api-key-here"

This is a PLACEHOLDER and won't work!

## How to Fix:

1. Get your Vercel AI Gateway API key from:
   https://vercel.com/dashboard/ai-gateway

2. Open .env.local file in your editor

3. Replace the line:
   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="your-anthropic-api-key-here"
   
   With:
   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="your-actual-vercel-gateway-key"

4. Save the file

5. Restart the dev server:
   - Stop current server (Ctrl+C)
   - Run: npm run dev

## What the key looks like:
- Usually starts with "vag_" or similar
- About 50-100 characters long
- Different from a Claude API key (which starts with "sk-ant-")

## For Production (Vercel):
Add the same key to Vercel environment variables:
https://vercel.com/nyuchitech/nyuchi-lingo/settings/environment-variables
